     Function ddwwaarrff__ffoorrmmeexxpprrlloocc() returns DW_DLV_OK on success.  In case of an
     error, it returns DW_DLV_ERROR and sets argument _e_r_r.

EERRRROORRSS
     Function ddwwaarrff__ffoorrmmeexxpprrlloocc() may fail with the following errors:

     [DW_DLE_ARGUMENT]       One of arguments _a_t_t_r, _r_e_t_l_e_n or _r_e_t_e_x_p_r was
                             NULL.

     [DW_DLE_ATTR_FORM_BAD]  The attribute referenced by argument _a_t_t_r was not
                             of form DW_FORM_exprloc.

